{
  "version": 1,
  "courseId": 4958062,
  "courseSlug": "remix-course",
  "courseTitle": "Remix.js - The Practical Guide",
  "sourceLanguage": "en",
  "targetLanguage": "zh-TW",
  "lectures": [
    {
      "id": "34674482",
      "title": "From <form> to <Form>",
      "lectureOrder": 24,
      "videoOrder": 20,
      "sourceHash": "e70848a980cd75a76fdfb8afc72f2f652202d562ea556882443dcfd54474ac06",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.25,
          "end": 3.48,
          "en": "So at this point,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 3.48,
          "end": 6.3,
          "en": "we're able to submit data and load data",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 6.3,
          "end": 8.64,
          "en": "and execute the respective back and code",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 8.64,
          "end": 11.64,
          "en": "and therefore we're able to perform the two most",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 11.64,
          "end": 14.127,
          "en": "important backend tasks you have",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 14.127,
          "end": 17.91,
          "en": "in almost any full stack app you're building.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 17.91,
          "end": 20.73,
          "en": "I now, when I come back to this action again though",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 20.73,
          "end": 21.93,
          "en": "and take a closer look",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 21.93,
          "end": 25.23,
          "en": "at this form submission at user validation",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 25.23,
          "end": 28.32,
          "en": "and some related aspects that are important to",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 28.32,
          "end": 30.063,
          "en": "understand and know.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 30.9,
          "end": 35.64,
          "en": "And for that, let's go back here and add a third note.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 35.64,
          "end": 39.69,
          "en": "This is another note on Remix.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 39.69,
          "end": 43.74,
          "en": "Now I want you to watch this refresh icon again.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 43.74,
          "end": 45.619,
          "en": "If I click add note you see it",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 45.619,
          "end": 47.79,
          "en": "briefly turned to a cross.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 47.79,
          "end": 50.22,
          "en": "So what happened is that",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 50.22,
          "end": 52.53,
          "en": "a new HTTP request was sent",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 52.53,
          "end": 55.983,
          "en": "and a new page was returned by Remix in the end.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 56.88,
          "end": 59.07,
          "en": "This should make some sense because",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 59.07,
          "end": 61.47,
          "en": "we are redirecting here at the end of the action.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 61.47,
          "end": 63.57,
          "en": "So we are redirecting to a new page",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 63.57,
          "end": 65.01,
          "en": "which is the same page as before",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 65.01,
          "end": 68.52,
          "en": "but technically it's a new request sent by the browser",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 68.52,
          "end": 71.82,
          "en": "due to this redirect response we're sending back.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 71.82,
          "end": 74.07,
          "en": "So everything's working as intended, but",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 74.07,
          "end": 76.86,
          "en": "of course it would also make sense to stay",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 76.86,
          "end": 79.65,
          "en": "in the single page application world here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 79.65,
          "end": 82.83,
          "en": "If we are on this page and I add a new note",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 82.83,
          "end": 86.19,
          "en": "and I submit the note, it would make sense to",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 86.19,
          "end": 89.82,
          "en": "not send a new request that fetches a new page",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 89.82,
          "end": 91.26,
          "en": "because that means that we also",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 91.26,
          "end": 93.47999999999999,
          "en": "re-download all the JavaScript code.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 93.47999999999999,
          "end": 94.71000000000001,
          "en": "Sure, it might be cashed,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 94.71000000000001,
          "end": 97.92,
          "en": "but we still trigger a new download request",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 97.92,
          "end": 99.47999999999999,
          "en": "for all the JavaScript code",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 99.47999999999999,
          "end": 102.12,
          "en": "and we execute all that JavaScript code",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 102.12,
          "end": 104.58,
          "en": "that's used on the client site again.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 104.58,
          "end": 106.14,
          "en": "And we might want to avoid this",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 106.14,
          "end": 107.943,
          "en": "if we're already on the page.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 109.89,
          "end": 112.97999999999999,
          "en": "To achieve this, we can go back to our form",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 112.97999999999999,
          "end": 115.77000000000001,
          "en": "and replace this default form element,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 115.77000000000001,
          "end": 118.74000000000001,
          "en": "which generally worked fine as you saw",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 118.74000000000001,
          "end": 121.29,
          "en": "with another form component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 121.29,
          "end": 123.03,
          "en": "which starts with a capital F,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 123.03,
          "end": 127.113,
          "en": "and which must be imported from Remix run React.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 129.18,
          "end": 131.853,
          "en": "Of course, we also must replace the closing tag.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 133.41,
          "end": 136.5,
          "en": "Now this form still renders a form as before",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 136.5,
          "end": 139.2,
          "en": "and you can still add those attributes,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 139.2,
          "end": 142.62,
          "en": "which you can add to the normal form element,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 142.62,
          "end": 145.203,
          "en": "but it behaves slightly differently.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 146.13,
          "end": 148.56,
          "en": "If we save everything here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 148.56,
          "end": 151.023,
          "en": "and I add a fourth note,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 152.7,
          "end": 157.35,
          "en": "another note, and you watch this refresh icon again.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 157.35,
          "end": 159.54,
          "en": "You see, now it did not spin and yet",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 159.54,
          "end": 162.66,
          "en": "the data was submitted and the loader was triggered,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 162.66,
          "end": 166.41,
          "en": "even though we technically did not reload this page.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 166.41,
          "end": 168.87,
          "en": "We can also tell that the page wasn't reloaded",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 168.87,
          "end": 170.643,
          "en": "because the inputs weren't cleared.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 171.69,
          "end": 172.95,
          "en": "Now, still the loader",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 172.95,
          "end": 175.68,
          "en": "was triggered because as I mentioned before,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 175.68,
          "end": 178.07999999999998,
          "en": "Remix automatically does the thing",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 178.07999999999998,
          "end": 179.85,
          "en": "you would expect to happen.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 179.85,
          "end": 183.36,
          "en": "Now with this special form component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 183.36,
          "end": 185.88,
          "en": "being used here instead of the default form,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 185.88,
          "end": 188.22,
          "en": "we stay in the single-page application world,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 188.22,
          "end": 192.54,
          "en": "and Remix actually prevents the page from being reloaded",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 192.54,
          "end": 194.31,
          "en": "but it still behind the scenes,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 194.31,
          "end": 196.02,
          "en": "sends a request to the backend",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 196.02,
          "end": 198.36,
          "en": "and triggers this action, so to say.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 198.36,
          "end": 201.75,
          "en": "It still performs all this code and it still",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 201.75,
          "end": 204.84,
          "en": "notices that we want to redirect to the notes page,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 204.84,
          "end": 207.87,
          "en": "but it does this with client site routing thereafter,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 207.87,
          "end": 210.36,
          "en": "instead of triggering a new request",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 210.36,
          "end": 212.673,
          "en": "that would actually fetch a new page.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 213.9,
          "end": 217.17000000000002,
          "en": "And it triggers the loader again because it understands",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 217.17000000000002,
          "end": 220.82999999999998,
          "en": "that we triggered an action and the data might have changed,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 220.82999999999998,
          "end": 224.19,
          "en": "and it should therefore fetch the updated data.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 224.19,
          "end": 225.81,
          "en": "As always, you can see that if you go",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 225.81,
          "end": 230.41,
          "en": "to the network tab and we add a fifth note here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 231.27,
          "end": 233.79,
          "en": "you see we got some requests here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 233.79,
          "end": 235.92000000000002,
          "en": "no 300 request anymore.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 235.92000000000002,
          "end": 239.38,
          "en": "So no redirect request, but a post request",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 240.54,
          "end": 244.47,
          "en": "which includes the form data that we submitted",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 244.47,
          "end": 249.45,
          "en": "under payload, and then thereafter another request,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 249.45,
          "end": 252.39,
          "en": "a get request, which in the end triggered that loader.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 252.39,
          "end": 254.613,
          "en": "So which, gave us the updated data.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 256.14,
          "end": 257.82,
          "en": "And that's what Remix does for you.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 257.82,
          "end": 260.43,
          "en": "Again, blending backend and frontend",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 260.43,
          "end": 263.76,
          "en": "while keeping the backend code on the backend.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 263.76,
          "end": 265.17,
          "en": "And therefore typically,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 265.17,
          "end": 268.59,
          "en": "you want to use this form component provided",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 268.59,
          "end": 271.2,
          "en": "by Remix instead of the default form element",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 271.2,
          "end": 274.56,
          "en": "so that you stay in this single page world.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 274.56,
          "end": 277.17,
          "en": "It's not bad if you use the default form,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 277.17,
          "end": 280.11,
          "en": "but with that we avoid the extra request.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 280.11,
          "end": 282.6,
          "en": "However, this form component really shines",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 282.6,
          "end": 287.253,
          "en": "if we then use more extra features provided by Remix.",
          "zh": ""
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "errors": []
}
